    "html": "<p>The graph shows a cycle ABCDA of an ideal gas, where AB and CD are adiabatic.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The pressure of the gas at C is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"200\\:\\textup{kPa}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the pressure of the gas at D?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"390\\:\\textup{kPa}\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"460\\:\\textup{kPa}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1200\\:\\textup{kPa}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2000\\:\\textup{kPa}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
